Error: Jet.DerivedReturnsNothing: `reactive.derived` must compute and return a value
  --> Tests/UI/reactive_derived_returns_nothing.jet:5:26
    |
  5 |     ^d: reactive.derived(fn() {
    |                          ^^^^^^
 Why: A derived value is recomputed from its signals; its lambda has to return the value
 Fix: Return a value from the body, or use `reactive.autorun(fn() { … })` for a side effect
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.DerivedReturnsNothing
